        "Today, virtual reality is used in areas such as education, medicine, architecture, industry and entertainment. It allows people to practice procedures, explore three-dimensional spaces, design models and simulate situations that would be difficult, costly or risky to reproduce in reality.",

    "La realidad virtual es el resultado de décadas de investigación e innovación tecnológica. Su evolución demuestra cómo los primeros experimentos para representar imágenes en tres dimensiones dieron paso a sistemas capaces de crear experiencias inmersivas. A medida que continúe integrándose con otras tecnologías, su potencial seguirá creciendo y ofrecerá nuevas formas de aprender, trabajar e interactuar con el mundo digital.":
        "Virtual reality is the result of decades of research and technological innovation. Its evolution shows how the first experiments to represent images in three dimensions gave way to systems capable of creating immersive experiences. As it continues to be integrated with other technologies, its potential will keep growing and offer new ways to learn, work and interact with the digital world.",

